WEBVTT

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:04.140
Is that him?

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:05.470
It's him!

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.330
Kicking him out is only just.

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:12.470
I can't believe him.

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:15.740
Maybe now we can all feel a little better.

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:25.280
With Ikelos exiled from Orario, 
the uproar has begun to die down.

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:29.820
From monsters appearing on the 
surface to everything else,

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:32.810
it's all being seen as the 
work of the Ikelos Familia.

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:37.130
Through playing the part of a visible 
scapegoat for us, everything was wrapped up.

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:41.150
But nothing has, in fact, been resolved.

00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:45.870
The Xenos, unable to return to the Dungeon,
 still hide within the city.

00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:49.190
With the Loki Familia at the forefront,

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:55.460
adventurers continue their search 
through the whole of Daedalus Street.

00:00:56.700 --> 00:01:00.790
It is only a matter of time 
before they are discovered.

00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:05.330
And, with Ikelos now gone,

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:08.210
the town has ended up turning 
the blame toward Bell-kun.

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:11.670
A symbolic target for their malice, is he?

00:01:12.070 --> 00:01:17.720
Yes. Good children can become infinitely 
cruel through their own virtue.

00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:21.610
You've gotta be kidding me!
That Little Rookie!

00:01:21.890 --> 00:01:25.700
Acting like an idiot just because he wanted 
the recognition? That blasted rabbit!

00:01:26.630 --> 00:01:29.980
Must've let getting called the Record Holder
 or whatever go to his head!

00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:31.960
Serves him right.

00:01:31.960 --> 00:01:35.740
He's had people fawning all over him, 
but this will put an end to that.

00:01:37.750 --> 00:01:39.450
What was that for, Mord?

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:41.610
Quit yapping! Just shut up and drink!

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:15.990
Is It Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon? III

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:27.470
Stigma
Downfall

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:26.760
Welcome home, Mikoto-kun, Haruhime-kun.

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:28.600
Nothing happened in town, did it?

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:31.950
Nothing direct, but...

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:35.900
Compared to before, 
the gazes upon us were, well...

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:39.890
It does seem that Bell-dono's 
actions have had an effect.

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:44.740
And the increased criticism from the people 
of the town is something palpable.

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:47.330
I see.

00:03:50.010 --> 00:03:51.500
Is Welf-dono still...

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:54.130
Yeah. Shut himself away this whole time.

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:02.340
<i>I decided to save her.</i>

00:04:04.420 --> 00:04:05.940
<i>I don't regret it.</i>

00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:09.250
<i>No matter what anyone says 
to me, it doesn't bother me.</i>

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:11.370
<i>But...</i>

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:16.050
Come in!

00:04:17.050 --> 00:04:18.660
Bell-kun, there's a visitor.

00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:20.420
For me?

00:04:21.930 --> 00:04:24.920
Considering you're the 
city's most hated person,

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:26.680
you're looking pretty well, Bell-kun.

00:04:26.680 --> 00:04:27.450
Hermes!

00:04:27.810 --> 00:04:29.800
Looked at objectively, it's the truth.

00:04:29.800 --> 00:04:31.920
You've all heard the talk 
in town, haven't you?

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:35.610
Did you go out of your way to 
come here just to make fun of us?

00:04:35.610 --> 00:04:37.160
Now that you're satisfied, hurry up and leave!

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:39.810
The Xenos are waiting for your help.

00:04:41.950 --> 00:04:43.270
What do you mean?

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:46.010
There's no point in hiding things now.

00:04:46.010 --> 00:04:49.260
Ouranos has asked for my help with them, too.

00:04:49.820 --> 00:04:52.270
Up until now, I've been making 
moves in the shadows.

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:55.390
Where are they all now?

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:59.740
I've got Asfi and the others looking, 
but we don't have a grasp on things yet.

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:03.420
It seems they've split into groups 
and are hiding separately,

00:05:03.420 --> 00:05:08.130
but regardless, they are unlikely to have 
moved from under Daedalus Street.

00:05:08.760 --> 00:05:12.480
Loki's children are in 
Daedalus Street, aren't they?

00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:13.430
Yes.

00:05:13.430 --> 00:05:15.920
Freya-sama's eyes are shining 
in the direction of Babel,

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:19.870
and the Ganesha Familia has tightened 
their guard at the Dungeon's entrance.

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:22.650
They must have decided that, 
if the monsters are here,

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:25.660
they wouldn't be anywhere 
outside Daedalus Street.

00:05:26.150 --> 00:05:28.130
Ais-chan and the others 
are on the lookout, too.

00:05:28.380 --> 00:05:29.710
Ais-san, too?

00:05:31.620 --> 00:05:34.340
Hermes, this would be a gamble,

00:05:34.340 --> 00:05:36.720
but what if we told Loki and 
the others everything?

00:05:37.350 --> 00:05:39.160
We wouldn't ask for cooperation.

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:43.600
If they'd just allow the Xenos to return to 
the Dungeon this once, that would be enough.

00:05:43.600 --> 00:05:44.320
Won't work.

00:05:45.560 --> 00:05:47.310
Even if Loki agreed,

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:51.490
the children would never concede to 
the idea of mercy toward monsters.

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:56.680
Finn Deimne's dearest wish is to 
restore the glory of his people.

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:59.800
He would never knowingly do anything 
that would make him give that up.

00:06:01.770 --> 00:06:04.270
Even if they know they are intelligent,

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:07.430
for them, monsters are monsters.

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:10.550
There is no option other than annihilation.

00:06:23.910 --> 00:06:26.280
You are a curious one, aren't you, Bell-kun?

00:06:26.710 --> 00:06:29.520
Deliberately wanting to come to 
Daedalus Street, of all places.

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:31.190
I'm sorry.

00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:35.340
But after hearing what Hermes-sama said,
 I couldn't just sit around.

00:06:35.340 --> 00:06:36.230
Huh?

00:06:36.230 --> 00:06:38.840
You! You're the Little Rookie, aren't you?

00:06:39.740 --> 00:06:43.530
I'm amazed you came walking through here,
 you disgrace of an adventurer!

00:06:43.530 --> 00:06:45.570
Don't go looking like everything's fine!

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:47.260
Hey, say something!

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:48.810
Who do you think you are?

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:49.970
What are you doing here?

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:51.280
Look what you've done!

00:06:50.830 --> 00:06:53.060
All of you, that's enough!

00:06:54.150 --> 00:06:58.270
Bell-kun took the actions 
he did because of my debt!

00:06:58.470 --> 00:07:02.240
Put another way, it was the 
result of his deep love for me!

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:05.240
If you're going to blame anyone, blame me!

00:07:05.700 --> 00:07:06.790
Let's go, Bell-kun.

00:07:06.790 --> 00:07:08.390
R-Right.

00:07:08.730 --> 00:07:11.360
I'm sorry, Goddess. 
Making you do that for my sake...

00:07:11.540 --> 00:07:16.090
Don't worry about it! Lately, you haven't 
been as difficult to handle, anyway.

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:21.040
Actually, I'm a little happy about it. 
Lets me live up to my reputation as a goddess.

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:23.780
Thank you, Goddess.

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:28.700
But with things like this, and trying 
to look for Wiene and the others...

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:29.930
Yeah.

00:07:29.930 --> 00:07:32.130
Making any careless moves would be bad.

00:07:34.380 --> 00:07:35.110
Huh?

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:41.510
Huh? Huh?!

00:07:45.080 --> 00:07:48.140
Won't you please step aside,
 Wallenwhatsit-kun?

00:07:50.020 --> 00:07:52.910
Hey! Are you listening, Whatsit-kun?

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:53.580
Ais-tan, what's goin' on?

00:07:53.790 --> 00:07:54.660
Loki!

00:07:54.900 --> 00:07:57.290
What's this? It's the shrimp.

00:07:57.610 --> 00:08:01.100
Ais-tan, don't make any side trips.
Just go straight to Finn, okay?

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:01.820
Okay.

00:08:10.870 --> 00:08:12.450
Kid...

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:15.000
You went and did something 
pretty amusing, huh?

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:20.670
Dunno what you did it for, but you must've 
known it would drop your standing, right?

00:08:20.670 --> 00:08:23.760
Getting cursed at by all the people 
who've been praising you 'til now...

00:08:23.760 --> 00:08:25.750
How's it feel?

00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:26.730
Huh?

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:27.410
Hold on!

00:08:27.410 --> 00:08:29.330
What do you think you're doing?

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:31.030
Stay away from Bell-kun!

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:34.910
Aw, come on. I went to the trouble 
of meddling and everything, right?

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:36.720
No one asked you to!

00:08:36.720 --> 00:08:38.860
Let's hang out some more! 
Hold up there, kid!

00:08:37.060 --> 00:08:38.860
Oh, stop it already!

00:08:38.860 --> 00:08:41.630
Bell-kun, this is your chance to escape!

00:08:38.860 --> 00:08:42.800
Won't you talk with me a little more? 
I've suddenly taken quite an interest in you!

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:45.080
No need to take an interest! 
Bell-kun, hurry up!

00:08:42.800 --> 00:08:45.080
Oh, come on! It's fine!

00:08:45.080 --> 00:08:47.710
Hey, kid! Wait!

00:08:45.080 --> 00:08:47.710
I'm sorry. If you'll excuse me!

00:08:55.600 --> 00:08:59.550
<i>If it were just me... I'm ready for 
whatever they might say to me.</i>

00:09:00.280 --> 00:09:02.470
<i>And my goddess would cover for me,
 like she did back there.</i>

00:09:03.170 --> 00:09:03.980
<i>But...</i>

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:08.930
Bell-san?

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:10.550
Syr-san.

00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:11.860
I'm so glad!

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:15.440
I haven't seen you lately, 
so I've been worried.

00:09:15.440 --> 00:09:16.990
I'm sorry.

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:21.250
Shall we walk a little while?

00:09:22.440 --> 00:09:27.820
I... You know the way people in 
town see me right now, don't you?

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:29.780
Yes, of course.

00:09:32.040 --> 00:09:36.130
And then that silly Mama Mia ate 
my packed lunch in one bite.

00:09:36.130 --> 00:09:39.550
"Don't waste food!" she said.

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:43.550
You really aren't going to ask me anything?

00:09:44.160 --> 00:09:46.140
If you want me to, I will.

00:09:47.960 --> 00:09:49.480
Are you unsure about something?

00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:58.830
It's better not to try to take 
on everything by yourself.

00:09:59.190 --> 00:10:03.000
Bell-san, you have everyone in your 
familia there for you now, don't you?

00:10:06.220 --> 00:10:07.210
I'm scared.

00:10:09.510 --> 00:10:11.500
I'm scared to find out.

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:14.520
I didn't ask anyone what they thought.

00:10:14.520 --> 00:10:16.090
I just ran off on my own.

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:19.080
I got my friends caught up in all of 
it and caused them so much trouble.

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:22.680
I... I...

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:23.850
If you'll excuse me.

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:24.340
Huh?

00:10:24.650 --> 00:10:26.340
Huh? Wha? Wait!

00:10:26.530 --> 00:10:28.810
It's all right. Just stay like this.

00:10:29.150 --> 00:10:31.740
Don't be afraid. Don't hesitate.

00:10:32.110 --> 00:10:34.560
You may have lost things, but...

00:10:35.210 --> 00:10:39.120
I'm sure there are true things 
that remain by your side.

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:42.430
For me...

00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:45.460
the way you always keep running...

00:10:45.810 --> 00:10:46.950
is why I like you.

00:10:51.680 --> 00:10:53.670
I brought dinner!

00:10:54.580 --> 00:10:58.060
And keep it down at night 
so we don't bother the neighbors, okay?

00:11:09.510 --> 00:11:14.180
The search of Daedalus Street by the 
Loki Familia has begun in earnest.

00:11:14.920 --> 00:11:17.640
The reality is, we should see 
this as race against time.

00:11:17.640 --> 00:11:20.750
The cornered Xenos will 
surely make a move soon.

00:11:21.590 --> 00:11:24.200
And they are likely to turn to...

00:11:24.470 --> 00:11:26.530
Yes. Bell-kun and the others.

00:11:26.530 --> 00:11:33.160
But the doors to Knossos, which connects to
the Dungeon, are under Loki Familia's control.

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:38.370
Even with reinforcements, a frontal 
assault would only lead to total defeat.

00:11:38.810 --> 00:11:41.460
But it isn't as though there 
are no options at all.

00:11:43.850 --> 00:11:47.220
The blueprints for Knossos, Daedalus' notes.

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:51.720
I had Ikelos give them to me.

00:11:51.720 --> 00:11:54.890
The contents have been investigated. 
I can vouch for them.

00:11:55.660 --> 00:11:56.880
Ouranos...

00:11:56.880 --> 00:11:59.950
I will take on bringing the 
curtain down on this uproar.

00:11:59.950 --> 00:12:02.460
Of course, I will be expecting compensation.

00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:05.560
What do you think? You need this, right?

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:14.960
First, monsters possessing intelligence, 
the Xenos, then Knossos, is it?

00:12:15.240 --> 00:12:17.350
We lack manpower.

00:12:17.350 --> 00:12:19.520
To ascertain the extent of the current lull,

00:12:19.520 --> 00:12:20.810
we ask your assistance.

00:12:21.290 --> 00:12:24.150
Lion, if you would lend us your aid,

00:12:24.150 --> 00:12:28.760
I promise to provide you with information 
on the remnants of Evilus.

00:12:30.480 --> 00:12:34.040
But, you know, regardless of whether 
they speak or have intelligence,

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:38.530
the thought of saving monsters... 
I just can't make sense of it.

00:12:39.730 --> 00:12:43.520
They aren't existences which 
should be shown mercy, are they?

00:12:43.520 --> 00:12:46.970
Rescuing the Xenos was the client's request.

00:12:47.320 --> 00:12:51.910
As you have joined the Hermes Familia, 
you will also quietly obey, please.

00:12:52.300 --> 00:12:55.020
I'm just not good at 
understanding things, you see.

00:12:55.020 --> 00:12:58.680
If I don't like it, I may just spit in 
your face and get violent, you know?

00:12:59.940 --> 00:13:01.730
Allow me to say, then,

00:13:01.730 --> 00:13:06.310
that Bell Cranel is also trying to show 
mercy to these beings you call "monsters."

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:07.760
What did you say?

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:09.880
To put it bluntly,

00:13:10.270 --> 00:13:13.390
I'm not sure if helping the 
Xenos is the right thing to do.

00:13:13.720 --> 00:13:18.490
I mean, you know why, right? Aboveground, 
their existence is simply poisonous.

00:13:18.840 --> 00:13:21.680
The truth is that, even now, 
they've only brought chaos and confusion.

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:23.640
But still...

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:26.880
We are also having difficulty deciding.

00:13:27.240 --> 00:13:31.530
As of yet, we have not disclosed anything 
about the Xenos to our children.

00:13:32.570 --> 00:13:36.520
Are they really existences we 
should be saving, do you think?

00:13:39.820 --> 00:13:43.350
Whether the Xenos' existence is right 
or wrong isn't something we can decide.

00:13:43.730 --> 00:13:46.080
But we can't just leave things like this.

00:13:46.080 --> 00:13:47.020
Right.

00:13:47.420 --> 00:13:50.220
Then, let us make our decision.

00:13:52.540 --> 00:13:54.900
Have you deciphered it, Supporter-kun?

00:13:55.090 --> 00:13:56.030
Yes.

00:13:56.030 --> 00:13:58.710
It was, as we thought, 
a letter from Fels-sama.

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:02.370
I don't know if it was wariness of 
it being found by other adventurers,

00:14:02.370 --> 00:14:04.900
but the cipher was insanely complicated.

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:11.540
"Tomorrow night, head for the hidden door 
in Daedalus Street that leads to Knossos."

00:14:11.930 --> 00:14:15.090
"Additionally, I ask for your aid," is it?

00:14:17.300 --> 00:14:21.700
"I have prepared all sorts of magic items 
which will be useful to this operation."

00:14:21.700 --> 00:14:23.130
Or so it says.

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:27.580
It's just like an invitation from an evil 
god leading to a path of destruction.

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:31.860
All right.

00:14:31.860 --> 00:14:36.060
Why don't we decide this now? 
The path we'll take from here.

00:14:36.710 --> 00:14:41.390
Do we save the Xenos and live 
as outcasts in Orario, or...

00:14:41.390 --> 00:14:45.720
Do we abandon them, and wait for our 
lives to go back to the way they were?

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:47.960
It's one of the two.

00:14:51.770 --> 00:14:53.480
I know what I will do.

00:14:56.220 --> 00:15:00.610
I will save Wiene and Lyd 
and the other Xenos!

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:03.040
I decided that's what I will do!

00:15:03.970 --> 00:15:07.120
But... the rest of you...

00:15:09.080 --> 00:15:10.100
Hestia-sama...

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:13.100
Can't we add one more option?

00:15:13.740 --> 00:15:18.150
We handle things really well, 
and return them to the Dungeon.

00:15:18.150 --> 00:15:21.350
And then, no one blames 
or criticizes us for it.

00:15:23.430 --> 00:15:24.010
Huh?

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:25.550
Look at this.

00:15:25.970 --> 00:15:26.900
It's a magic sword.

00:15:27.210 --> 00:15:29.370
There are three more in my workshop.

00:15:29.920 --> 00:15:31.400
Impressive as always, Welf-dono.

00:15:32.590 --> 00:15:35.340
Five days spent cooped up for four swords?

00:15:35.340 --> 00:15:37.790
Couldn't you have managed just 
one more for a sharper ending?

00:15:38.740 --> 00:15:40.470
Even this took everything I had!

00:15:40.470 --> 00:15:43.840
If we're going to be outmaneuvering 
adventurers and saving the Xenos,

00:15:43.840 --> 00:15:45.940
we can't just sit around 
being stubborn, can we?

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:50.040
Bell-kun, everyone has been planning 
to do that from the beginning.

00:15:50.430 --> 00:15:52.240
There is no need to hesitate.

00:15:52.240 --> 00:15:54.300
I will follow you, Bell-dono.

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:56.990
I was once saved by you.

00:15:56.990 --> 00:16:00.270
Why would I fear destruction now?

00:16:00.270 --> 00:16:05.460
Lili doesn't want to abandon Bell-sama, 
or see him abandoned by others.

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:07.990
I'm used to being an outcast.

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:09.700
So, Bell...

00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:11.670
Don't leave us behind anymore.

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:13.990
Everyone...

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:19.070
I'm sure there are true things 
that remain by your side.

00:16:21.170 --> 00:16:23.540
Thank you... everyone!

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:24.950
That's decided, then.

00:16:25.280 --> 00:16:28.040
We will save the Xenos together!

00:16:32.600 --> 00:16:34.260
Let's go save Wiene and the others!

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:14.180
Just now, I received a reply from 
Bell Cranel and the others.

00:17:14.180 --> 00:17:16.960
They will give you their full cooperation.

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:19.520
Tonight, we will leave this place.

00:17:19.520 --> 00:17:21.870
Once we have forced our way 
through Daedalus Street,

00:17:21.870 --> 00:17:24.450
we will escape into the 
Dungeon through Knossos.

00:17:25.550 --> 00:17:28.330
I am certain the Loki Familia will 
have seen through everything,

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:32.040
but as Ouranos cannot take overt action,
 we have no other options.

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:37.200
Do we just need to reach the door? 
Won't the adventurers follow us?

00:17:37.530 --> 00:17:40.750
Currently, we are the only 
ones who possess keys.

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:43.530
As long as we succeed in running to the door,
 the rest should work itself out.

00:17:44.050 --> 00:17:47.160
What do we do about Fear, Lett, 
and the others who got separated?

00:17:47.390 --> 00:17:51.130
Once the operation commences, we will 
send a signal. That is all we can do.

00:17:51.740 --> 00:17:54.500
We are prepared for the adventurers 
to suspect something is amiss.

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:56.710
Will Bell be coming with them?

00:17:57.140 --> 00:17:58.070
No.

00:17:59.360 --> 00:18:02.290
Bell Cranel will serve as decoy.

00:18:02.860 --> 00:18:06.270
Fels, you would use 
Bell-san like this again?

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:07.550
Fiend!

00:18:07.550 --> 00:18:08.230
Bag of bones!

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:09.550
I hate Fels!

00:18:09.550 --> 00:18:11.590
Wait! Listen to what I have to say!

00:18:11.590 --> 00:18:13.100
And being bones has nothing 
to do with this!

00:18:16.170 --> 00:18:20.000
Given the chain of disturbances, 
Bell Cranel stands out too much.

00:18:20.360 --> 00:18:23.460
He is the most suitable for drawing 
the attention of the adventurers.

00:18:23.460 --> 00:18:25.330
A diversion, then.

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:26.650
But...

00:18:26.650 --> 00:18:29.860
Relying on Bell-cchi and the others again,
 causing them all this trouble...

00:18:30.200 --> 00:18:34.720
Please, understand. They are 
the only ones we can rely on.

00:18:35.750 --> 00:18:38.340
My head understands, but...

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:40.080
Lyd...

00:18:40.080 --> 00:18:42.700
Haruhime taught me this.

00:18:43.050 --> 00:18:46.610
On the surface, they have a thing 
called "repaying kindness."

00:18:46.610 --> 00:18:47.990
Repaying kindness?

00:18:47.990 --> 00:18:48.900
Yeah.

00:18:48.900 --> 00:18:53.730
She said you give the person who helped 
you all kinds of things to say thank you.

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:59.410
So, one day, we can help Bell and 
the others lots and lots, okay?

00:19:00.600 --> 00:19:02.700
You've changed.

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:04.990
Though I can't say how, exactly...

00:19:05.310 --> 00:19:06.490
Really?

00:19:06.720 --> 00:19:07.690
Okay.

00:19:07.690 --> 00:19:11.940
Then once all this is over, we'll repay 
Bell-cchi and the others' kindness a lot!

00:19:11.940 --> 00:19:13.070
Yeah!

00:19:13.330 --> 00:19:17.040
Then, let us begin discussions 
with Bell Cranel and the others.

00:19:20.540 --> 00:19:22.640
Can you hear me, Bell Cranel?

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:25.890
<i>I can hear you, Fels-san!</i>

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:28.120
It's Bell! Bell! Bell!

00:19:28.120 --> 00:19:28.680
<i>Wiene!</i>

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:30.510
Bell, have you been well?

00:19:28.990 --> 00:19:30.510
It has been some time, Bell-san.

00:19:30.510 --> 00:19:32.810
Bell, I want to hurry up and see you!

00:19:30.860 --> 00:19:32.810
Bell-cchi, it's us! It's Lyd!

00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:34.860
Quiet! They'll find us!

00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:35.060
Bell! Bell! Bell!

00:19:35.280 --> 00:19:37.880
There are six entrances to Knossos.

00:19:37.880 --> 00:19:42.200
Below Daedalus Street to the 
northeast, northwest, west,

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:45.330
southwest, southeast, and east.

00:19:45.650 --> 00:19:51.990
But according to our information, the Loki 
Familia has only made four defense teams.

00:19:51.990 --> 00:19:52.590
Which means...

00:19:52.860 --> 00:19:56.530
They've only found four of 
the doors, right?

00:19:56.860 --> 00:19:57.790
Right.

00:19:57.790 --> 00:20:03.050
Then, if we aim for the open doors, we can 
break through the Loki Familia's forces.

00:20:03.270 --> 00:20:04.060
Yes.

00:20:04.060 --> 00:20:08.390
But as to which of the doors 
their forces are stationed at,

00:20:08.390 --> 00:20:10.780
even Ouranos and the others 
haven't found that out.

00:20:10.780 --> 00:20:14.520
<i>Unfortunately, we do not have the 
time to investigate that in advance.</i>

00:20:15.050 --> 00:20:19.460
<i>Knowing the dangers, we must determine 
that as we proceed with the plan.</i>

00:20:20.960 --> 00:20:22.650
In that case,

00:20:22.650 --> 00:20:26.320
it doesn't seem like we'll be able to 
avoid clashing with the Loki Familia.

00:20:26.590 --> 00:20:30.170
<i>Even so, we want to limit the scope of 
the fighting to the absolute minimum.</i>

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:34.320
<i>And so, that is where you 
come in, Bell Cranel.</i>

00:20:37.150 --> 00:20:41.140
Bell Cranel is a distraction ploy. 
That is, he is being used as a decoy.

00:20:41.710 --> 00:20:44.180
Whether it is of his own 
volition or not aside,

00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:47.710
he is in a position to be used by 
the monsters and their leader.

00:20:48.500 --> 00:20:51.670
Looking at the sequence of events thus far,
 there is no question of that.

00:20:52.500 --> 00:20:54.860
While our attention is turned toward him,

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:58.310
the enemy will head toward the 
nearest entrance to the labyrinth.

00:20:58.760 --> 00:21:02.810
So the place we must pay attention 
to is the place Bell Cranel is not.

00:21:02.810 --> 00:21:05.780
Defend the doors to Knossos 
to the very last.

00:21:06.130 --> 00:21:10.740
And what we must pay most attention 
to is that black minotaur.

00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:13.800
When it appears, the first 
priority is its subjugation.

00:21:14.380 --> 00:21:16.320
The enemy will move soon.

00:21:16.320 --> 00:21:19.050
Do not let them have their way. 
Stop them with everything you've got!

00:21:21.540 --> 00:21:24.050
The former Sage may have 
the wisdom of years,

00:21:24.520 --> 00:21:27.490
but in standard practice, 
you can't outmaneuver Braver.

00:21:27.940 --> 00:21:29.670
He's just much too clever.

00:21:31.090 --> 00:21:35.530
How many magic items are capable of 
exceeding Finn Deimne's thinking?

00:21:36.080 --> 00:21:38.090
If there is a means of escape, 
that would be it, but...

00:21:39.110 --> 00:21:41.560
What is most important is, after all, him:

00:21:43.390 --> 00:21:44.780
Bell Cranel.

00:21:59.410 --> 00:22:02.090
<i>We're going to save them. All of them!</i>

00:23:35.970 --> 00:23:40.980
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:35.970 --> 00:23:40.980
<b>Invisible
Forced Breakthrough</b>

00:23:37.530 --> 00:23:38.530
Next time,

00:23:38.530 --> 00:23:39.850
"Invisible."
